# M365 Admin Scripts

A collection of Microsoft 365 administration and reporting scripts.

## Areas Covered

### Exchange Online
- Mailbox Reports
- Shared Mailboxes
- Mailbox Permissions
- Distribution Groups

### Entra ID
- Guest Users
- Admin Roles
- Password Changes
- Licensing

### SharePoint Online
- External Users
- Site Collections
- Site Administrators

### Microsoft Defender
- Device Inventory
- Managed Devices
- Security Reporting

## Requirements

- Exchange Online PowerShell
- Microsoft Graph PowerShell
- PnP PowerShell

